---
/**
 * @category Hero
 * @theme classic
 * @name Hero2
 */
---
<section
  class='bg-stone-50 grid grid-cols-1 w-full py-12 px-2 items-center gap-8 sm:py-16 sm:px-4 sm:gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:px-8 md:py-20 lg:px-16 lg:py-24 lg:gap-8'
>
  <div
    class='col-span-full flex flex-col justify-center items-start gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:col-span-6 md:gap-4 md:px-4'
  >
    <div
      class='flex justify-center items-center bg-sky-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full sm:px-3.5'
    >
      <span
        class='text-sky-800 text-xs font-semibold sm:text-sm'>Čerstvé</span
      >
    </div>
    <h1
      class='text-stone-800 font-sans text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-4xl sm:leading-tight md:text-5xl md:leading-none md:tracking-[-0.02em] lg:text-7xl lg:leading-none lg:tracking-[-1.44px]'
    >
      Čerstvý chleba z&nbsp;naší pece
    </h1>
    <p
      class='text-stone-500 font-sans text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed sm:text-base sm:leading-6 md:text-lg md:leading-7 lg:text-base lg:leading-6'
    >
      Každý den od 6.30 pečeme kváskový chleba, koláče a něco sladkého ke kávě. Žádné polotovary, žádné příplatky, jen poctivá „Pekárna Na Růžku“
    </p>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 mt-4 sm:flex-row sm:gap-2 sm:mt-2'>
      <button
        class='whitespace-nowrap flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-2.5 bg-yellow-400 text-sm text-stone-800 font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-500 transition-colors duration-100 sm:px-5'
      >
        Vzít chleba
      </button>
      <button
        class='whitespace-nowrap flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-2.5 text-stone-800 text-sm font-semibold bg-transparent border border-stone-200 hover:bg-stone-100 transition-colors duration-100 rounded-md sm:px-5'
      >
        Zastavte se na kávu
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class='col-span-full flex items-center justify-center md:col-span-6 md:px-4'
  >
    <img
      src='/assets/images/content/hero-bg.webp'
      alt='Hlavní fotografie'
      class='w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-square rounded-lg'
    />
  </div>
</section>
